<%# A page of a creation in steps: a table, a character. Use the steps_page helper (steps_band_helper.rb), through
    creation_page (a table) or character_creation_page (a character). Across the whole width beside the navigation,
    like "My tables": the band of the steps on top (band, rendered already), then the content, whose rows of cards
    run from edge to edge. flush_top: the content touches the band (a cover from edge to edge).
    The page is at least as high as the screen (on a phone, less the room kept under the floating bar), and its
    content a column that fills it: the buttons of a step (mt-auto) sit at the bottom of the screen on a short page,
    neither sticky nor fixed (decision) %>
<div class="flex min-h-[calc(100dvh-5rem)] flex-col md:min-h-dvh">
  <%# The band stays at the top of the screen: its steps lead back to the pages reached. It slides away while the
      page scrolls down and comes back when it scrolls up (hide_on_scroll_controller.js), or when a step gets the focus %>
  <header class="sticky top-0 z-20 border-b border-line bg-surface px-4 py-4 data-scrolled-away:-translate-y-full motion-safe:transition-transform motion-safe:duration-200 sm:px-8 md:py-5"
          data-controller="hide-on-scroll"
          data-action="scroll@window->hide-on-scroll#update focusin->hide-on-scroll#show">
    <%= band %>
  </header>
  <main class="flex flex-1 flex-col <%= creation_main_classes(flush_top) %>">
    <%= render "shared/flashes" %>
    <%= content %>
  </main>
</div>
